[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0010","text":"“小恶魔式的”吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0020","text":"——如果是雾子的话\n会怎么演？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0030","text":"诶……\n那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0040","text":"该怎么做……才好呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0050","text":"恋钟酱也……在犹豫……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0060","text":"啊，确实很难呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0070","text":"“小恶魔”——……\n嗯，原来如此——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0080","text":"要不要试试……那种把人耍得团团转的感觉……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0090","text":"耍得团团转……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0100","text":"是啊，比如不听话之类的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0110","text":"我试试……看……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0120","text":"雾子……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0130","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0140","text":"哈哈，你现在是在试着演小恶魔吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0150","text":"……嗯，这样下去\n两个人就都沉默了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0160","text":"——雾子，不用回答我也行？\n试着演小恶魔，感觉怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0170","text":"…………\n好难……呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03080000_02_0180","text":"小恶魔小姐……好厉害……"}]
